  "boundaries": [
    "No new compiler/runtime syntax or native search implementation; receiver/error scopes, stack options, C-string validation and count-result assignment remain.",
    "Native plain warmed search uses two allocations/frees per query in this workload, same for prepared language query. Re-evaluated language string literal adds one allocation/free per query; all three paths are recorded for JIT/dynamic/static on both OS. No equal CPU-throughput or universal zero-overhead claim.",
