    "Count failure preserves destination assignment, not a universal promise of native document rollback. Navigation/current replacement use raw native statuses; callers must check them.",
    "All eleven declarations execute on actual CPU-Proxy models. Visual rendering, full code-provider/callback integration, remaining native-resource lifetimes and final SDK/IDE installation are separate.",
